  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nOnce upon a time there was an old mother pig who had one hundred little pigs and not enough food to feed them. So when they were old enough, she sent them out into the world to seek their fortunes. You know the story about the first three little pigs. This is a story about the 92nd little pig.\n\nThe 92nd little pig built a house out of depleted uranium. And the wolf was like, \"dude, where did you get the uranium?\". And the 92nd little pig was like, \"I mined it out of the ground\". \n\n\"How did you do that?\" \n\n\"With a shovel\" said the pig.\n\nAnd the wolf was like, \"that's pretty cool and all but I really meant, how did you mine it from the ground?\"\n\n\"It mined itself. It's self-mining depleted uranium\" said the pig.\n\nAnd the wolf was like, \"that is so cool!\"\n\nAnd the wolf was like, \"can I come in and see it?\"",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 9,
  "reference_text": "\n\nAnd the pig was like, \"sure\" and he let the wolf in.\n\nThe wolf advanced toward the pig. \"I'd stop if I were you,\" said the pig, and reached for a nearby wand. Holding the wand near his belly a loud clicking filled the room.\n\n\"What’s that?\"",
